{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q140289","formula":"C₁₁H₁₉NO₈","hill":"C11H19NO8","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":11.0,"H":19.0,"N":1.0,"O":8.0},"names":{"en":"N-acetyl-beta-muramic acid","ru":"N-Ацетилмурамовая кислота"},"descriptions":{"en":"N-Acetylmuramic acid (NAM or MurNAc) is an organic compound with the chemical formula C11H19NO8. It is a monomer of peptidoglycan in most bacterial cell walls, which is built from alternating units of N-acetylglucosamine (GlcNAc) and N-acetylmuramic acid, cross-linked by oligopeptides at the lactic acid residue of MurNAc.","ru":"N-Ацетилмурамовая кислота или НАМ — органическое вещество, производное моносахарида — простой эфир N-ацетилглюкозамина и молочной кислоты. Вместе с N–ацетилглюкозамином (посредством β(1→4)-гликозидной связи) входит в состав структурного компонента клеточной стенки бактерий гетерополимера муреина."},"fame":22,"pubchemCid":12917651,"mass":293.27,"charge":0,"smiles":"C[C@H](C(=O)O)O[C@@H]1[C@H]([C@@H](O[C@@H]([C@H]1O)CO)O)NC(=O)C","inchikey":"MNLRQHMNZILYPY-YVNCZSHWSA-N","iupac":"(2R)-2-[(2R,3R,4R,5S,6R)-3-acetamido-2,5-dihydroxy-6-(hydroxymethyl)oxan-4-yl]oxypropanoic acid","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"12917651","atoms":39,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-2.786,"y":-0.69,"z":-0.084,"el":"O"},{"x":0.998,"y":0.801,"z":-0.634,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.136,"y":2.583,"z":0.127,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.985,"y":-2.871,"z":0.068,"el":"O"},{"x":-5.024,"y":0.834,"z":0.364,"el":"O"},{"x":1.493,"y":-2.868,"z":-1.412,"el":"O"},{"x":3.82,"y":2.363,"z":0.949,"el":"O"},{"x":3.547,"y":0.302,"z":0.038,"el":"O"},{"x":0.669,"y":-1.866,"z":0.52,"el":"N"},{"x":-0.144,"y":0.406,"z":0.129,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.387,"y":-1.09,"z":-0.095,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.347,"y":1.243,"z":-0.31,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.641,"y":0.683,"z":0.